<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-04T15:37:13.678Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 15:37:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Algerian forces have moved into Niger to protect energy interests, joining state actors in the Sahel insurgency. Islamist militants continue abducting Islamic school students in Niger State, while bandits in Niger demand over ₦100 million ransom for the same abductees. Gunmen attacked a market in north-central Nigeria, killing four and wounding five, and a Russian electronic-warfare vehicle was spotted in Mali. Human Rights Watch reports that an Islamist armed group targeted civilians in Burkina Faso. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5oT2RKWWJoT2VJVi0xcnlZWXFiMVZtUXVFUmF1VHBXTVZVRGtnQmplWU00XzZVZHJVRmVubWRGY3NEOFlZVnNCVTM5cTczc05CX21QUlg2OHRBY1p1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Nation Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE5peTdlTVJZUmV2VGxCcklqTjVidnBSSW9fZERqREgtbE84dnJRR1RDTVF4aHJ2c2tscmlyeE9KTEhuYTQzeE4xclZtcXlOOXhmX2Vzd2dWcWZkVHBGN0h1bkVOTXliRU8zSy1J?oc=5&quot;&gt;allAfrica.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPd2FGQzZfOV9VcGRhUHEzVmVLX2NpdEpzcGh5QzlHTUpub0N5ODJNb3lQN1VGYlVRT1hPVkR4SGFiM1JmcXlxV2lmYll4ZVd2S3RBTllOM012eHJuX1ZlSHhMOUNFTWM3OGF3QUFwZndnVnUtc0dnRlpkMVZ6NEVvWFpGOHZrSDJQZnUxaTRmU0NXNlYyVldCTkF3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Defence Blog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOVUJaRHBjb1NjZnp6YUpzNzhzbjhaY3FucjBnaW9DR2VwVDBoMzl6cmVaUEtUNlczNnF1T3NMSUY0eVhCTzl4czFibkpNT0dKbURmVzdkd3ZQczhpdFlKMVQwZDBiNF9YN0dkTTQzS2lHUTVSTnNTcFhmdGVnNGdWUHRVNmwxT1Q3R0lETkdxZFJiQ0pqUnNFR1dBd3RlU0MteXV0blJVcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Escudo Digital&lt;/a&gt;, &lt